{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2d4e547f0a05db65025c6a1c9fb51e2fb8bda633b35f189b63411e62a45fa2ea", "ja": "（明日は響達のライブフェスティバルだが、まだ準備が\n終らない……。えっと、この後は演出を詰めて……）", "zh": "（明天就是响她们的演唱会祭典了，但准备工作\n还没结束……我看看，之后把舞台效果弄好……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "4179727ce287a7d7460eb20f6770077a2498383cc5b5c87c70b859c03e20e1f8", "ja": "{$P$}、遅くまでお疲れさまっ！\nリハーサル、ちゃんと見てくれた？", "zh": "{$P$}，忙到这么晚真是辛苦了！\n你有看到我们排练吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d357d5817aaf7341750dab5403f5a1398a8cf04a3094fc3581c2c18bb3af0ede", "ja": "響か、お疲れさま。もちろん見せてもらったよ。\nバッチリだったんじゃないか？", "zh": "是响啊，辛苦了。\n我当然有看啰，你们表现得很完美呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "663b05c0b8eafacac57f663d9e06806ff3574ecc44a11cc6ef51125e3b4bfbd4", "ja": "えへへっ、でしょでしょ？\nやっぱり自分たち、カンペキだよね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，对吧对吧？\n我们果然是无懈可击的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "25f7a36b001ae587b03bedab445c7e67701de51c89e23aa1b71d6ae91f58ef00", "ja": "でも……、もしかして{$P$}は、\nあんまりバッチリじゃなかったりする？", "zh": "不过……{$P$}的状态，\n该不会不太完美吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3a114462b332f8c71bedf65f263fbb13cad4a7431af150c8ca21a066f845c821", "ja": "え？　どうしてそう思うんだ？", "zh": "咦？你为什么这么想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "b0573424f431eda3650915ec86652865d94a1a020b117d5383555b3bbdee9423", "ja": "だってさっき、難しい顔してたから。\nお腹が空いたときのハム蔵みたいだったぞ。", "zh": "因为你从刚才就面有难色，\n好像肚子饿的哈姆藏喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4d4f5e17e09be3e8a0ab19fb8c8df93ee00aa1f15969d0c6e658bd63de3de0f3", "ja": "そ、そうなのか。一体どんな顔を……\nいや、ちょっと残ってる準備のことを考えてたんだ。", "zh": "是、是这样吗？我到底是什么表情……\n没有啦，我是在思考剩下的准备工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8b5c100d6e9f22d3612ae6bf6c7a0696c3f037528b00fc03bea863c299329ca5", "ja": "でも大丈夫だよ。\nもうひと頑張りで全部終わるから、安心してくれ。", "zh": "不过没事的，\n我再拚一下就可以全部完成了，放心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "298e375c89f57208f7a5489996a82446b5d4a6075f54692423d98fd0253c45d9", "ja": "そう？　もしお腹が空いたなら、自分に言ってよね。\n何か作ってあげるぞ！", "zh": "是吗？如果你肚子饿了，要跟本人说喔。\n本人做点什么给你吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ecd2dae3bdc7338aef04582dc3aa8f3349284032154f9b268ae016f711574330", "ja": "とんでもない。遠征中、しかも本番前日の\nアイドルに、そんなことさせられないって。", "zh": "那怎么好意思，不能让正在远征，\n而且明天就要正式上场的偶像做这种事啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "a72a21f34f7a0573ad563e4655f7a2782e48e265f57df7f80f19c2a818a5d6fd", "ja": "別に遠慮しなくていいぞ？　自分、いつも動物たちの\nご飯をいっぱい作ってるから、慣れてるさー。", "zh": "不用客气喔，本人常常帮动物们准备大量食物，\n所以习惯了啦──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_1012_p", "source_sha256": "4daf5073f6e2dbc4542bc9832def8833e4b9b26a913051cf510985d0d3bdd2f6", "ja": "なるほど。\nつまり、動物の代わりに……。", "zh": "原来如此。\n也就是说，把我当成动物……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "4a64f5a7bb9fc749f3557a165009ebc88ffd1d057346c706eb33ab551eda4e11", "ja": "あ、ご飯じゃなくてもいいけど。何かない？\n自分にして欲しい、元気が出そうなこと！", "zh": "啊，也不一定要准备吃的，但你有没有什么\n希望本人来做，能让你打起精神的事情？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "36b59c1b842bac4d5336bfffb95d99c9db728efd733fb30a4303a3075a2ebcb3", "ja": "ほら、自分、アイドルでしょ？\nみんなを元気にするのが仕事だからね！", "zh": "你知道的，本人是偶像嘛！\n工作就是让大家获得活力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "065902c301f979311559bcb9998ed24fda5bc0c964dc2d59a59f62d43308863a", "ja": "{$P$}1人ぐらい、あっという間に\n元気にしてみせるさー！　さあ、なんか言ってみて！", "zh": "就{$P$}一个人，\n本人会让你瞬间充满活力啦──！来，说说看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d3da071edda8fd1da2d14595418b30324b312c7d4231f57e56fb2e5dd8448332", "ja": "響はアイドルだから、か。\nそれじゃ、アイドルらしいことを頼もうかな。", "zh": "毕竟响可是偶像，是吗……\n那么，就拜托你做些偶像会做的事情好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "3e59a33cc43e8ed6012439978df1a6865e32cbaf8f7954146d75191a78acfffb", "ja": "え？　アイドルらしいこと？", "zh": "咦？偶像会做的事情？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_1018_p", "source_sha256": "b5add6aca1892fc126b087bd12e58aa3a5511c8c8304200f2046559be323034e", "ja": "そう、アイドルらしく、明日のライブを最高に\n盛り上げて、みんなを元気にしてあげてくれ。", "zh": "没错，请你展现偶像风范，将明天演唱会的气氛\n炒热到最高点，让大家获得活力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "bfbce880deb41c825acb26ea7da4288e1cc49a9119c020383e70e3dbf4ed8f77", "ja": "……おおっ、それいいね！　うん、約束するっ！\n明日は自分が思いっきり、最高に盛り上げるさー！", "zh": "……哦哦，这个好！嗯，本人答应你！\n本人明天会用尽全力把气氛炒热到最高点啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_1020_013hib", "source_sha256": "feeeefc3df1f01fc36bc83269d58db16eb1fc84d36437d936d86634ad9da3214", "ja": "って、明日じゃ遅いぞ！？　{$P$}に\n元気出してほしいのは、今なのに～！", "zh": "是说，明天就太迟了吧！？\n本人想要{$P$}现在就打起精神耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_1021_p", "source_sha256": "50e754034df9029305b024ae1cf5e57e620f0f302bcd288cf0b3a776d033e329", "ja": "いや、大丈夫だよ。\nちゃんと今、元気にしてもらえたから。", "zh": "不用，没关系啦。\n因为我已经从你那边充分得到活力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "372f11be4e43af50eeb8ae3797571410dd850fcda76634fcca13503cf5042df5", "ja": "え？　でも……\n自分、まだ何にもしてないぞ？", "zh": "咦？可是……\n本人什么都还没做耶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_1023", "source_sha256": "83579a02754410cad9125d557c8eba4608251046fc1d2724735aae273e12a7ee", "ja": "したぞ", "zh": "你做了", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_2000_p", "source_sha256": "4e9654f635e3efc9db10f3ea83402a1c833163d378236f9fd0e84cf611d7773f", "ja": "明日は最高に盛り上げるって、約束してくれただろ？\nおかげですっかり、やる気も元気も出てきたよ。", "zh": "你不是答应我明天会把气氛炒热到最高点吗？\n多亏这句话，我的干劲跟活力都恢复了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_2001_p", "source_sha256": "efe149046c7adcea47cd5d93f50ed3efab4e22178b882684d6feeddfdd1d1639", "ja": "自信をもって約束してくれるなんて、さすがだな。\nありがとう！", "zh": "信心十足地做出承诺，真不愧是响呢。\n谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_2002_013hib", "source_sha256": "221da0a59b9add587a506a584647fae61cbbfb6416026ee7bf7d5daf4ccbb645", "ja": "そんなの……当たり前だし……。\nあ、でも……そっか。", "zh": "这是……理所当然的嘛……\n啊，不过……对喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_2003_013hib", "source_sha256": "9f0ee7939f86ac4809acb36038f4dcfacf906af0ce75c2f9310aa5e7dd53c195", "ja": "あの、あのさ、{$P$}。\n自分からもお礼を言うね。……ありがと！", "zh": "那个，{$P$}，你听本人说。\n本人也想道谢……谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_2004_p", "source_sha256": "69357feb0295d1b76447bdb8868fad5327947a791cb99589336ae9c4bab04534", "ja": "うん？　どうして響がお礼を言うんだ？", "zh": "嗯？为什么响要跟我道谢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_2005_013hib", "source_sha256": "e133f6fd53caaa9dfa73c5d6255aff1ed69acc5d3d789788ca5156cc6a7a2938", "ja": "だって、あれで元気が出たってことは、\n自分を信じてくれてるってことだから……。", "zh": "因为，那句话能让你打起精神，\n就表示你很信任本人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0124_2006_013hib", "source_sha256": "71c8108bd29fb749a717f9e2624cb4f7f21e87e14e8389dd6f931702cbafcc89", "ja": "そういうの、すっごくうれしいんだぞ！\nだから……ありがとねっ。えへへ♪", "zh": "这让本人超开心喔！\n所以……谢谢你，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
